1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,779
Ren: If traffic stops, you are already
late.

2
00:00:03,449 --> 00:00:07,290
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
two of ten: the van.

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:10,129
Ren: Two hundred twenty-six kilometres to
go.

4
00:00:10,799 --> 00:00:13,895
Ren: Fourteen cars. One exit.

5
00:00:14,565 --> 00:00:16,395
Ren: Stop. Count the exits.

6
00:00:17,065 --> 00:00:19,325
Ren: Do not honk. Never honk.

7
00:00:19,995 --> 00:00:20,728
Ren: One.

8
00:00:21,995 --> 00:00:22,555
Ren: Two.

9
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:24,562
Ren: Three.

10
00:00:25,995 --> 00:00:28,503
Ren: A jam is a trap with doors.

11
00:00:29,173 --> 00:00:32,710
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Cache opened. Cache
opened. Cache opened.

12
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:36,496
Ren: The engine turns over. The horde
turns with it.

13
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:41,690
Ren: One thing a horde cannot follow. A
dead engine.

14
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,433
Ren: The dead end saves me.

15
00:00:45,103 --> 00:00:48,098
Ren: Day one. Two hundred twenty-six to
go.

16
00:00:48,768 --> 00:00:51,995
Ren: Then a knock. From the back of the
other van.

17
00:00:52,665 --> 00:00:58,512
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part two of ten, The Quiet
Hand. Next: the kid on the roof. Follow for part three.

